-- GetAbilitySound by a string, tried with every ability and buff of the game's data (1072 ids): the id as text, the
-- object's name, the sound label the by-id native gives it, that label in lower case and the looped label, each as an
-- effect and a looped sound; how many answered something and the first few that did.
local E, L = ConvertSoundType(0), ConvertSoundType(1)
local asked, hits, withLabel = 0, {}, 0
local count = 0
